# This is a comment
# This example is for mad 1 in Lazor
# x = no block allowed
# o = blocks allowed
# A = fixed reflect block
# B = fixed opaque block
# C = fixed refract block
GRID START
o o o o
o o o o
o o o o
o o o o
GRID STOP

# 2 reflect blocks and 1 refract block to place
A 2
C 1

# laser: x, y, vx, vy
L 2 7 1 -1

# points the laser must intersect
P 3 0
P 4 3
P 2 5
P 4 7
